  "description": "Find the country behind an IP address with Country.is, the free, keyless IP geolocation API: the country and continent of any IPv4 or IPv6 address, with the city, region, postal code, coordinates, time zone and network where known, for up to 100 addresses in one step. Check whether an address is in the countries you name, to branch a workflow on where a sign-up, an order or a visitor comes from, and see which country Lodol itself calls out from. The data is MaxMind's GeoLite2, updated daily. No account or API key required.",
